urname>Naobumi</surname><given-names>Yashiro</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahiro</surname><given-names>Kinoshita</given-names></name><name><surname>Jun</surname><given-names>Yoshigi</given-names></name><name><surname>Takeshi</surname><given-names>Kasai</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Small Bowel Obstruction Due To Pickled Japanese Apricot: CT Findings</article-title><source>Journal of Computer Assisted Tomography</source><year>2002</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>132</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11801917</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00004728-200201000-00021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zonnebelt</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolberg</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ascending Cholangitis secondary to chicken bone lodged at The Ampulla of Vater</article-title><source>Am J Surg</source><year>1981</year><volume>141</volume><fpage>610</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7013517</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0002-9610(81)90063-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meltzer</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldberg</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recurrent pancreatitis caused by vegetable matter obstruction</article-title><source>Am J Gastroenterol</source><year>1986</year><volume>81</volume><fpage>1091</fpage><lpage>2</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3776961</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maglinte</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Reyes</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Harmon</surname><given-names>BH</given-names><